{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apocalipsis Pelucho is and old-school, Doom-like shooter with a cute aesthetic and tons of fluffy animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic FPS Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom through levels filled with enemy hordes while you collect weapons, find hidden areas and unravel the story of Oslo, the Brave Dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Most Engaging Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet some other doggies. Find out who the real enemy is. Guide Oslo to discover his true mission and destiny. Deep stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Included Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-10+ levels filled with secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-8+ plushie-feeding weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A dozen different enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A bunch of achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Costs no money at all, has no microtranstactions. Yippie!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886300?t=1755075232","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886300?t=1755075232","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886300/47ebbf3bf926ae7bbfbe92a74a584454b41d0c71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755075232","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886300/47ebbf3bf926ae7bbfbe92a74a584454b41d0c71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755075232","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apocalipsis Pelucho is and old-school, Doom-like shooter with a cute aesthetic and tons of fluffy animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic FPS Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom through levels filled with enemy hordes while you collect weapons, find hidden areas and unravel the story of Oslo, the Brave Dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Most Engaging Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet some other doggies. Find out who the real enemy is. Guide Oslo to discover his true mission and destiny. Deep stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Included Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-10+ levels filled with secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-8+ plushie-feeding weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A dozen different enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A bunch of achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Costs no money at all, has no microtranstactions. Yippie!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","developers":["Luctor"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886300/34389e6cc7cac1eed834a6dbd5aa865ad5651e1b/header.jpg?t=1755075232","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3886300/432267246/13650d6e92bab80399680779972be34f201b062a/1752953704/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753732256","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.co